flowchart LR
  Web[Internal workspace\nOperations dashboard] --> OpsAPI[FastAPI /operations\ninternal role gate]
  OpsAPI --> Metrics[OperationsService\ntenant-scoped aggregation]
  Metrics --> Runs[(Runs + events)]
  Metrics --> Usage[(Model usage)]
  Metrics --> Agent[(Agent execution metrics)]
  Metrics --> Tools[(Tool executions)]
  Metrics --> Routing[(Routing decisions)]
  Metrics --> Docs[(Document chunks)]
  Router[Model Router\nprovider circuit] --> Metrics
  Metrics --> Alerts[Threshold + SLO alerts]
  Alerts --> Runbook[On-call runbooks\nincident process]
  Logs[JSON logs + request ID] --> Cloud[CloudWatch / external log sink\nproduction target]
  Metrics --> Cloud
